  "solution": "Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></semantics></math> (<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℕ</mi></mrow></semantics></math>) là số đồng xu của tầng thứ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>n</mi></semantics></math> của tháp.<br>Dựa vào mô hình xếp đồng xu thì dãy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> là một cấp số cộng với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>809</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>120</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, tổng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>60</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>723</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>723</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>3</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>809</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>120</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Giải ra ta được <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>27</mn></mrow></semantics></math> hoặc <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>2249</mn><mn>60</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Kết hợp điều kiện, suy ra tháp có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>27</mn></semantics></math> tầng.",
